<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA BEAT ZIMBABWE BY SIX WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA BEAT ZIMBABWE BY SIX WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka beat Zimbabwe by six wickets in the fifth match of the Singer World Series one-day limited overs cricket tournament on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scores: Zimbabwe 227-5 innings closed (C.Evans 96 not out, A.Campbell 54), Sri Lanka 228-4 in 47 overs.</p>
